Author:     Geoff Lankow <geoff@darktrojan.net>
AuthorDate: Fri Jan 17 08:50:10 2025 +0200
Commit:     Geoff Lankow <geoff@darktrojan.net>
CommitDate: Fri Jan 17 08:50:10 2025 +0200

    Bug 1901705 - Remove Windows Live Mail importer. r=aleca


    This isn't actually connected to anything. Windows Live Mail is well past EOL and while the last
    version is compatible with Windows 10 it's been replaced by the Mail app there. We no longer
    support Windows 7 or 8.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D233771

